lty for Lang.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Lang laps in 4m02.36s and leads by 7 seconds from Farina, Caracciola, Cortese, Biondetti and Aldrighetti; Ghersi and Baruffi are already out.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":1,"text":"Lang laps in 4m02.36s and leads by 7 seconds from Farina, Caracciola, Cortese, Biondetti and Aldrighetti; Ghersi and Baruffi are already out.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Cortese, fourth, and Trossi both retire with broken pistons.","q":false,"c":19},{"lap":2,"text":"Lang made his second lap in 3m46.67s. Farina ran second, then Caracciola, Aldrighetti, Biondetti, Emilio Villoresi, Severi, and Pintacuda.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":2,"text":"Cortese, fourth, and Trossi both retire with broken pistons.","q":false,"c":19},{"lap":2,"text":"Lang made his second lap in 3m46.67s. Farina ran second, then Caracciola, Aldrighetti, Biondetti, Emilio Villoresi, Severi, and Pintacuda.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":4,"text":"Farina loses three or four seconds a lap to Lang and concentrates on holding off Caracciola.","q":false,"c":17},{"lap":4,"text":"Farina loses three or four seconds a lap to Lang and concentrates on holding off Caracciola.","q":false,"c":17},{"lap":7,"text":"On the seventh lap Lang's lap time was down to 3m45.67s while Caracciola had passed Farina for second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":7,"text":"On the seventh lap Lang's lap time was down to 3m45.67s while Caracciola had passed Farina for second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":8,"text":"Luigi Villoresi's streamliner returns after long repairs but soon retires with a broken piston.","q":false,"c":18},{"lap":8,"text":"Luigi Villoresi's streamliner returns after long repairs but soon retires with a broken piston.","q":false,"c":18},{"lap":11,"text":"Now overheating seriously struck the Alfa Romeos. First to retire was Farina and he was soon to be followed by Aldrighetti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":11,"text":"Now overheating seriously struck the Alfa Romeos. First to retire was Farina and he was soon to be followed by Aldrighetti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":17},{"lap":13,"text":"Pit stops begin: Lang first, then Caracciola and the Alfa Romeos.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":13,"text":"Pit stops begin: Lang first, then Caracciola and the Alfa Romeos.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":14,"text":"Severi and then Biondetti drop out; Rocco, past Pietsch, is fifth in the works Maserati.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":14,"text":"Severi and then Biondetti drop out; Rocco, past Pietsch, is fifth in the works Maserati.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":16,"text":"Capelli arrives at his pit exhausted, rejoins in confusion, then pulls off before he collapses.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":16,"text":"Capelli arrives at his pit exhausted, rejoins in confusion, then pulls off before he collapses.","q":false,"c":20},{"lap":18,"text":"Pintacuda retires; Lang has lapped everyone except his team mate and is closing on Caracciola.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":18,"text":"Pintacuda retires; Lang has lapped everyone except his team mate and is closing on Caracciola.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Lang closes on Caracciola but chooses not to lap him and cruises.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":28,"text":"Lang closes on Caracciola but chooses not to lap him and cruises.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"So Lang took the victory and Caracciola completed the Mercedes triumph with his second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Rocco, fourth, runs out of fuel on the last lap; Emilio Villoresi is third and Taruffi fourth.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":30,"text":"So Lang took the victory and Caracciola completed the Mercedes triumph with his second place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Rocco, fourth, runs out of fuel on the last lap; Emilio Villoresi is third and Taruffi fourth.","q":false,"c":2}]}